.TH GHDIFF 1 "2026-08-20" "v1.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ghdiff \- display git diffs in a GitHub-style web UI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ghdiff
[OPTIONS] [\fIref1\fR [\fIref2\fR]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBghdiff\fR starts a local HTTP server that serves a dark-themed, interactive
diff viewer reminiscent of the "Files changed" tab on a GitHub pull request.
It opens your browser automatically (use \fB\-\-no-open\fR to disable).
.P
The frontend is a single-page application embedded in the binary. It fetches
diff data from a JSON API and renders split or unified views with syntax
highlighting, a file tree sidebar, and commit picker dropdowns.
.P
In git mode, \fBghdiff\fR shells out to \fBgit diff\fR on each request, so
changing refs via the UI shows live results. In stdin mode, the diff is parsed
once at startup.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-port \fIPORT\fR
HTTP server port. Use \fB0\fR (default) to auto-select a free port.
.TP
.B \-\-host \fIHOST\fR
HTTP server host (default: \fBlocalhost\fR).
WARNING: Binding to non-localhost addresses exposes repository contents.
.TP
.B \-\-no-open
Do not open the browser automatically on startup.
.TP
.B \-\-mode \fIMODE\fR
Initial view mode: \fBsplit\fR (default) or \fBunified\fR.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print usage information and exit.
.SH MODES
The mode is determined by the positional arguments:
.TP
.B (none)
\fImerge-base\fR mode: diff the working tree against the merge-base of HEAD
with the repository's main/master branch.
.TP
.B \fB.\fR
\fIworking\fR mode: show uncommitted changes (staged and unstaged) against HEAD.
.TP
.B \fIcommit\fR
\fIcommit\fR mode: diff the working tree against a specific commit.
.TP
.B \fIref1\fR \fIref2\fR
\fIcompare\fR mode: diff between two arbitrary refs (commits, branches, tags).
.TP
.B \fB\-\fR
\fIstdin\fR mode: read a unified diff from standard input.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Review current branch against main
ghdiff
.TP
View uncommitted changes
ghdiff .
.TP
Inspect a single commit
ghdiff HEAD~1
.TP
Compare two branches
ghdiff main feature-branch
ghdiff v1.0.0 v2.0.0
.TP
Pipe any unified diff
git diff HEAD~3 | ghdiff \-
cat changes.patch | ghdiff \-
.SH FILES
.BR ~/.gitconfig " (indirectly)"
Used by git for repository configuration.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/johanlundberg/ghdiff/issues
